# Files the image build never needs: build output, IDE metadata, JVM crash logs, OS folder
# metadata, gitignored local config, and test sources (the build neither compiles nor runs them).
# scripts/image-tag.sh doesn't hash this file, so an entry must never change what the image
# contains: each one is either gitignored (absent from the clean checkout CI builds from) or never
# reaches the image anyway (src/test); otherwise an edit here would change the image, not its tag.
**/target
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.factorypath
**/.idea
**/*.iml
**/*-local.yml
**/hs_err_pid*.log
**/replay_pid*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/src/test
